[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7381.189, "timestamp": "02:03:01", "text": "好吧，那事情就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7382.709, "timestamp": "02:03:02", "text": "然后我截了个图"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7384.31, "timestamp": "02:03:04", "text": "后来我就和那个人成了朋友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7386.629, "timestamp": "02:03:06", "text": "我截屏并点赞了这条消息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7388.31, "timestamp": "02:03:08", "text": "Instagram个人资料之类的，因为它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7391.51, "timestamp": "02:03:11", "text": "那是私密的，对吧，就像我一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7393.91, "timestamp": "02:03:13", "text": "她跟着那个人，但她没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7396.31, "timestamp": "02:03:16", "text": "好像她很想看似的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7399.109, "timestamp": "02:03:19", "text": "而不是像我之前那样寄给她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7403.03, "timestamp": "02:03:23", "text": "对他来说就是这样，然后他就像是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7405.189, "timestamp": "02:03:25", "text": "他就像发短信问了个问题一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7408.39, "timestamp": "02:03:28", "text": "马克回来了，我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7410.47, "timestamp": "02:03:30", "text": "还能说什么呢，因为那真是太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7412.31, "timestamp": "02:03:32", "text": "令人难堪，而且说实话，你也知道这很公平。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7414.229, "timestamp": "02:03:34", "text": "公平地说，我觉得我想出了类似这样的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7415.55, "timestamp": "02:03:35", "text": "好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7418.07, "timestamp": "02:03:38", "text": "嗯，顺便问一下，我只是想确认一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7420.229, "timestamp": "02:03:40", "text": "这是你的账号吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7423.43, "timestamp": "02:03:43", "text": "可以清楚地看到那人的脸，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7425.03, "timestamp": "02:03:45", "text": "就像你能从他的脸上看到他的脸一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7428.47, "timestamp": "02:03:48", "text": "他的个人资料照片在他的个人主页上，他的完整"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7429.375, "timestamp": "02:03:49", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "😂😂😂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7429.99, "timestamp": "02:03:49", "text": "法定姓名等等，我当时就想："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7432.229, "timestamp": "02:03:52", "text": "只是想确认一下这是你的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7434.99, "timestamp": "02:03:54", "text": "官方账号，他就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7438.87, "timestamp": "02:03:58", "text": "是的，还有另一个类似的例子。"}]